<title>JAPAN: Korea Airport launches 10 bln yen 3.05% samurai.</title>
<headline>Korea Airport launches 10 bln yen 3.05% samurai.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following samurai bond issue was announced by lead manager Yamaichi Securities on Wednesday:</p>
<p> BORROWER	  Korea Airport Construction Authority (KOACA)</p>
<p> AMT		 10 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON	    3.05 pct</p>
<p> MATURITY	  27 June 2007</p>
<p> ISS PRICE	 par</p>
<p> PAY DATE	  30 June 1997</p>
<p> SUB PERIOD	June 23 to June 27</p>
<p> PAY FREQ	  Semi-annual</p>
<p> LAST RATING     JBRI AA+</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGER    Yamaichi Securities</p>
<p> LEAD TRUSTEE    Industrial Bank of Japan</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8785</p>
</text>
